    {
      "change": "lift_reference_matches: replaced the per-match scalar grid scan with a vectorised neighbour search (_nearest_observation_within / _dense_rank). Radius, admission rule and the (distance, Point3D ID) tie-break are unchanged; output is bit-identical.",
